e options have also been updated.Persistent Player Appearances- Hair, beard, skin, and facial features are now persistent for 25,000 players. (thanks to Pedromaartz)- The same player keeps their appearance across matches, lineup introductions, and on-pitch scenes.Ma","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-23T13:45:02Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114036463","verified_at":"2026-10-23T14:03:50Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4761750-1847286114027767","game_id":"steam-4761750","kind":"update","title":"Update 0.1.1 is Live! – Redesigned UI, Match Visuals & Fixes","summary":"NOYAN CLUB CHAIRMAN — Demo Patch NotesWelcome, Chairmen!Thank you for all the feedback you’ve shared since the demo launched!This update focuses on making your daily club management experience clearer and more comfortable. We’ve redesigned management screens, improved squad and staff navigation, and addressed frustrating interactions such as input fields losing focus and lists refusing to scroll.New demo careers also include an extra match, alongside improvements to localization, match commentar","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T06:56:28Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114027767","verified_at":"2026-10-21T07:52:16Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4761750-1846651706691554","game_id":"steam-4761750","kind":"announcement","title":"Noyan: Club Chairman Demo Is Out Now!","summary":"The chairman’s seat is now yours.The Noyan: Club Chairman demo is out now!After a long development journey, we’re finally ready to share the first playable demo of Noyan with you.In Noyan, you’re not a footballer or a manager. You are the chairman of the club.Create your chairman, choose your club, and start shaping its future through the decisions you make.From transfers and club finances to facilities, stadium development, youth infrastructure, and commercial investments, the demo lets you exp","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:05:21Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691554","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:02:34Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4761750-1844115010491312","game_id":"steam-4761750","kind":"announcement","title":"Official Trailer is Out!","summary":"Dear Chairmen and Football Fans,The big moment has arrived for Noyan: Club Chairman, which we’ve been working on meticulously for a long time! Our First Official Trailer, showcasing exciting details about the game and the tension behind club chairmanship, is now live on YouTube!📺 Watch the Trailer: Are you ready to lead your team to the top and brave the pressure from the press and fans? Don't forget to share your thoughts with us after watching the trailer.To support us:Add the game to your Ste","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-17T08:55:58Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010491312","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:02:34Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4761750-1842846814446999","game_id":"steam-4761750","kind":"announcement","title":"Our Steam Page Has Been Revamped — Demo Coming October 19!","summary":"Hello Chairmen!We’ve completely revamped the Steam page for Noyan: Club Chairman. Along with brand-new screenshots that better capture the world of the game and the decisions awaiting you in the chairman’s seat, we’ve also reorganized and updated the page content.THE MANAGER COMMANDS THE PITCH, BUT YOU CALL THE SHOTS AT THE CLUBIn Noyan: Club Chairman, you’re not the manager—you’re the club chairman. Your job is to manage the finances, negotiate with sponsors, appoint the manager, have the final","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-04T15:45:43Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814446999","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:02:34Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4761750-1836506165564387","game_id":"steam-4761750","kind":"announcement","title":"🏆 Noyan: Club Chairman Demo Hits the Pitch This October 19!","summary":"Hello Chairmen!The support and interest you've shown since the first day we announced Noyan: Club Chairman has been absolutely incredible. Looking back today, seeing that we have passed the 7,000 Wishlists milestone as a small indie studio not only makes us extremely happy but also gives us immense motivation to push the game even further. Huge thanks to everyone who is with us, added the game to their wishlist, and shared our excitement!With your support, we continue to work day and night to po","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-01T06:00:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165564387","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:02:34Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4761750":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:07:14Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:07:13Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4761750":"2026-10-26T14:07:14Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4761750":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:07:13Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T14:07:13Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:07:13Z"},"4902340":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:07:14Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T14:07:14Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fullte